<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Holy Priests in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>Our phase 3 tier bonuses are very good, <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=33076/prayer-of-mending">
